    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in presenting this 3 bedroom, 3 bath semi-detached property to the market with the additional benefit of an attic conversion and self-contained unit to the rear. Located in the quiet Cul-de-sac of Earlsfort Lawn, Lucan and situated opposite a large green area, This highly desirable location finds itself within a stone's throw of a choice of essential amenities and dedicated transport links. You will find the M50 motorway mere minutes by car and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre is only a short drive away. Internal living accommodation of c. 89 sq.m comprises of entrance hallway with guest wc, lounge, dining room and kitchen/breakfast to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three well-proportioned bedrooms with the master benefitting from ensuite and also a family bathroom. from the landing you will find a Stira which offers access into the converted attic. Externally is one of this properties major selling points, you will find a fully enclosed, low maintenance WEST facing garden with a high degree of privacy, side access to the front which provides a driveway for off road parking and then also access to the fully fitted self-contained unit furnished with a kitchen/diner, lounge, bathroom and double bedroom, this unit also benefits from its own private garden. No. 27 is offered to the market in good condition throughout and offers no onward chain, based on the fantastic location and incredible opportunity on offer we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest.\n\n\nFeatures\n\nBER D2\nc. 134 Sqm\n3 bed, 3 bath\nConverted attic\nSelf-contained unit to rear\nWEST facing rear garden\nSought after location\nOpposite large green area\nNo onward chain\nDriveway to front\nClose to amenities\nFantastic opportunity\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nK78 RC03\n"
      },
      {
